#tab-ground:checked ~ nav label[for="tab-ground"] i,
#tab-safety:checked ~ nav label[for="tab-safety"] i,
#tab-help:checked ~ nav label[for="tab-help"] i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);margin:0 auto 4px}
.q{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--fg)}
.choices{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.choices input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;border:0}
.choices label{display:block;text-align:left;background:var(--elev);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;cursor:pointer}
.choices input:checked + label{border-color:var(--purple);background:rgba(167,139,250,.16);color:#fff}
.insight{margin-top:12px}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.btn{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.btn.gold{background:var(--teal);color:#10211f}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--fg)}
.note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--faint)}
label.f{display:block;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--gold);margin:10px 0 4px}
input[type="text"],textarea{width:100%;background:var(--elev);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
textarea{min-height:72px;resize:vertical}
.step{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
.step b{color:var(--fg)}
.warn{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--faint);margin:8px 16px 0}
a{color:var(--teal)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<input class="tab" type="radio" name="screen" id="tab-home" checked>
<input class="tab" type="radio" name="screen" id="tab-assess">
<input class="tab" type="radio" name="screen" id="tab-ground">
<input class="tab" type="radio" name="screen" id="tab-safety">
<input class="tab" type="radio" name="screen" id="tab-help">

<div id="view-home" class="view">
  <div class="hero">
<img id="heroImg" alt="A soft glowing lantern on a quiet stone path at night" src="@@HERO@@">
</div>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <p class="kicker">Private · On this device</p>
    <h1>Lantern</h1>
    <p class="tag">A calm space to understand relationship patterns, steady yourself, and take healthy next steps — at your pace, without shame.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <p>You are not “too sensitive” for noticing what hurts. Lantern keeps your notes private, works in this file, and is written to leave you feeling stronger — not more broken.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tools">
    <label class="tool" for="tab-assess">
<span class="dot" style="background:#a78bfa">
</span>
<div>
<b>Assess</b>
<span>A gentle quiz on red flags and emotional impact — clarity without harsh labels.</span>
</div>
</label>
    <label class="tool" for="tab-ground">
<span class="dot" style="background:#7ee0d6">
</span>
<div>
<b>Ground</b>
<span>Breathing, 5-4-3-2-1, body scan, and self-validation when you feel shaken.</span>
</div>
</label>
    <label class="tool" for="tab-safety">
<span class="dot" style="background:#9ecbff">
</span>
<div>
<b>Safety</b>
<span>Contacts, exit notes, digital privacy tips — stored only on this device.</span>
</div>
</label>
    <label class="tool" for="tab-help">
<span class="dot" style="background:#86efac">
</span>
<div>
<b>Help</b>
<span>Hotlines, next-step guidance, and books if you stay, set boundaries, or leave.</span>
</div>
</label>
  </div>
  <p class="warn">Not a diagnosis or crisis service. If you are in danger in Australia, call 000. 1800RESPECT is 1800 737 732.</p>
</div>

<div id="view-assess" class="view">
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <p class="kicker">Assess</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem">Relationship patterns</h1>
    <p class="tag">Answer honestly for yourself. There are no wrong answers. Private on this screen. Not a diagnosis.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
